WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:10.060
Eighty-five. Pros and cons of coffee. Our relationship with coffee is complicated.

2
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:18.060
Some people say they can't get up in the morning without it. Other people believe it's practically deadly.

3
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:23.060
When it comes to coffee, there are a lot of pros and cons.

4
00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:30.060
Here are a few of the pros. For one, coffee can be good for your body and your mind.

5
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:38.060
The caffeine in coffee, the chemical that wakes you up, might help prevent diabetes and Alzheimer's disease in the long term.

6
00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:44.060
In the short term, caffeine can improve mental performance and help with breathing problems.

7
00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:50.060
Coffee is also full of a kind of vitamin which protects the cells in your body.

8
00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:56.060
Other vitamins in it can help stop signs of aging and even prevent some cancers.

9
00:00:56.060 --> 00:01:04.060
In tests, coffee has also been shown to prevent Parkinson's disease, kidney stones, and liver problems.

10
00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:14.060
What could be bad about a drink like that? Well, on the flip side, coffee seems to cause or contribute to a lot of other diseases.

11
00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:20.060
It can raise cholesterol in the body and it's not good for your blood circulation.

12
00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:31.060
Coffee, as you have probably seen, can make you excited and nervous. It raises people's heart rates and, sometimes, blood pressure, which is dangerous.

13
00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:39.060
It also may cause you to lose water and feel thirsty. It may be bad for your bones, especially for women.

14
00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:44.060
There are even some studies that connect drinking coffee with heart disease.

15
00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:50.060
So, how can you decide if you should drink coffee? Consider your own circumstances.

16
00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.060
If you have a bad heart or high blood pressure, stay away from it.

17
00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:05.060
However, if you need to be sharp and you want to prevent some other diseases later in life, a cup of coffee in the morning probably won't hurt.
